  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656514",
      "title": "Reactive: Arrays of Form Controls (FormArray)",
      "lectureOrder": 535,
      "videoOrder": 490,
      "sourceHash": "e0512fe0ca1d15ee53fc34ff0e1bd573e2ec4c060dce18c8336d15df631a5f7c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.34,
          "end": 6.03,
          "en": "-: We covered a lot about the reactive approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.03,
          "end": 9.6,
          "en": "There is one other nice feature I want to show you though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.6,
          "end": 12.63,
          "en": "Let's add a new area to our form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.63,
          "end": 15.06,
          "en": "maybe below the radio buttons here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 18.093,
          "en": "Here I want to add a new div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.17,
          "end": 21.36,
          "en": "And in this div want to allow the user to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.36,
          "end": 24.48,
          "en": "dynamically add form controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.48,
          "end": 27.84,
          "en": "Let's say, I want to allow the user to add his hobbies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.84,
          "end": 32.84,
          "en": "so Your Hobbies, something like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.15,
          "end": 37.8,
          "en": "Then I'll add a button with some bootstrap classes button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.8,
          "end": 40.14,
          "en": "and then maybe button default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.14,
          "end": 41.43,
          "en": "Make it of type button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.43,
          "end": 43.35,
          "en": "That's important so that this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.35,
          "end": 46.14,
          "en": "doesn't accidentally submit the whole form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.14,
          "end": 48.9,
          "en": "And here I'll say Add Hobby.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.9,
          "end": 50.4,
          "en": "Now when a user clicks the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.4,
          "end": 54.69,
          "en": "I want to dynamically add a control to my form here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.69,
          "end": 57.3,
          "en": "And that's actually super simple to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.3,
          "end": 59.46,
          "en": "Specifically I want to add this control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.46,
          "end": 60.81,
          "en": "to an array of controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.81,
          "end": 63.69,
          "en": "because I might have multiple hobbies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.69,
          "end": 66.9,
          "en": "So I'll add a click listener here on onAddHobby.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.9,
          "end": 71.553,
          "en": "Seems like a, like an appropriate name for this method here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.39,
          "end": 76.56,
          "en": "And in there again, I want to add controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.56,
          "end": 79.51,
          "en": "So I'll add the method in my types group code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.375,
          "end": 83.07,
          "en": "onAddHobby, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.07,
          "end": 86.55,
          "en": "And now I need to add a new control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.55,
          "end": 89.343,
          "en": "type of control to my overall form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.33,
          "end": 91.28999999999999,
          "en": "I'll name it hobbies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.28999999999999,
          "end": 93.50999999999999,
          "en": "because that is what I'll store in there in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.50999999999999,
          "end": 95.64,
          "en": "And as I said, this should be an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.64,
          "end": 99.813,
          "en": "because it could be no hobbies, or 10, or 100.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.71000000000001,
          "end": 103.14,
          "en": "So the type here is not form control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.14,
          "end": 105.42,
          "en": "and it is not form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.42,
          "end": 108.57,
          "en": "Instead it's a FormArray.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.57,
          "end": 113.00999999999999,
          "en": "Make sure to import this from @angular/forms as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.00999999999999,
          "end": 117.99000000000001,
          "en": "Now a FormArray, of course, holds an array of controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.99000000000001,
          "end": 121.29,
          "en": "So you pass an array here to initialize it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.29,
          "end": 122.25,
          "en": "In this array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 124.71,
          "en": "you could already initialize some form controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.71,
          "end": 128.31,
          "en": "with new FormControl or like I am doing it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.31,
          "end": 131.913,
          "en": "you leave it empty to not have any hobbies at the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.2,
          "end": 136.47,
          "en": "Now when we click onAddHobby",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.47,
          "end": 139.92000000000002,
          "en": "I want to add a new hobby to that array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.92000000000002,
          "end": 143.76,
          "en": "So here I need to access my form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.76,
          "end": 148.65,
          "en": "Now I want to get access to my hobbies array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.65,
          "end": 152.92000000000002,
          "en": "And I can do this by getting hobbies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.29,
          "end": 156.84300000000002,
          "en": "It is a control in my overall form in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.678,
          "end": 159.84,
          "en": "And now I need to tell TypeScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.84,
          "end": 161.55,
          "en": "that this is of type form array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.55,
          "end": 163.5,
          "en": "to not get an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.5,
          "end": 164.88,
          "en": "You rarely have to do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.88,
          "end": 168.15,
          "en": "but here we have to explicitly cast this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.15,
          "end": 171.86,
          "en": "So by placing a lower than sign than FormArrays",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.86,
          "end": 176.01,
          "en": "of the type and then a greater than sign",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.01,
          "end": 178.82999999999998,
          "en": "and then placing this in parentheses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.82999999999998,
          "end": 180.54,
          "en": "we're telling TypeScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.54,
          "end": 183.63,
          "en": "This part here actually is a form array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.63,
          "end": 184.521,
          "en": "so everything enclosed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.521,
          "end": 188.22,
          "en": "in these outer parenthesis now is treated as form array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.22,
          "end": 191.82,
          "en": "So now I can push a new control on this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 191.82,
          "end": 196.14,
          "en": "If it would've not casted this, we would get an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.14,
          "end": 200.49,
          "en": "So now we can push a new form control there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 200.49,
          "end": 203.28,
          "en": "but I will outsource this to keep those lines short.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.28,
          "end": 205.47,
          "en": "So here the control is created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 205.47,
          "end": 207.543,
          "en": "and stored in a constant, FormControl.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 209.46,
          "end": 212.743,
          "en": "And the hobby, well that should be something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 212.743,
          "end": 215.1,
          "en": "the user can now enter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 215.1,
          "end": 220.1,
          "en": "So we'll actually create it with no default value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 220.29,
          "end": 222.09,
          "en": "Of course you could all change this behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.09,
          "end": 224.55,
          "en": "to pass an argument to onAddHobby",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.55,
          "end": 227.46,
          "en": "and then pre-populate it with this value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.46,
          "end": 229.35,
          "en": "I want to add a validator though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.35,
          "end": 230.25,
          "en": "So this still works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 230.25,
          "end": 232.71,
          "en": "because I'm creating a normal form control here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 232.71,
          "end": 235.14,
          "en": "So the required validator seems appropriate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 235.14,
          "end": 238.89,
          "en": "because the hobby input should not be empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.89,
          "end": 243.89,
          "en": "And now I can push this control on my array of controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.59,
          "end": 246.3,
          "en": "With this we are creating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 246.3,
          "end": 249.06,
          "en": "as we are able to add controls, but we won't see it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 249.06,
          "end": 252.51,
          "en": "We need to synchronize it with our HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.51,
          "end": 257.1,
          "en": "Therefore, on this outer div here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 257.1,
          "end": 261.21,
          "en": "I'll add a directive form ArrayName.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 261.21,
          "end": 262.8,
          "en": "So again, you see the pattern.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.8,
          "end": 266.76,
          "en": "We had form ControlName to tell Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 266.76,
          "end": 269.76,
          "en": "that we want to connect the input to a FormControl.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 269.76,
          "end": 272.64,
          "en": "We had formGroupName to do the same for a form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 272.64,
          "end": 276.54,
          "en": "And now we have formArrayName to do the same for an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 276.54,
          "end": 280.62,
          "en": "So formArrayName and the name was hobbies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 280.62,
          "end": 283.56,
          "en": "The name we chose in our TypeScript object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 283.56,
          "end": 285.42,
          "en": "This tells Angular that somewhere",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 285.42,
          "end": 288.33,
          "en": "in this div our array will live.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 288.33,
          "end": 290.15999999999997,
          "en": "Now we can use this array here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 290.15999999999997,
          "end": 291.93,
          "en": "So I will create a new div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 291.93,
          "end": 295.86,
          "en": "with the ID form-group, for example, bootstrap styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 295.86,
          "end": 298.02,
          "en": "And here I simply want to have an input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 298.02,
          "end": 301.32,
          "en": "which allows the user to enter the actual hobby.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 301.32,
          "end": 304.17,
          "en": "So this type text is all right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 304.17,
          "end": 306.21,
          "en": "I now somehow need to loop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 306.21,
          "end": 309.93,
          "en": "through all the controls which are in this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 309.93,
          "end": 313.74,
          "en": "So on my form-group here will actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 313.74,
          "end": 318.74,
          "en": "add a ngFor loop to loop through all my hobby controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 321.21,
          "end": 325.57,
          "en": "So in my signupForm, that would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 327.33,
          "end": 329.673,
          "en": "my hobbies, which I can get like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 330.62,
          "end": 332.433,
          "en": "And there're the controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 333.3,
          "end": 335.85,
          "en": "With that, I can loop through all them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 335.85,
          "end": 337.83,
          "en": "And I also want to extract the index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 337.83,
          "end": 339.48,
          "en": "of the current iteration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 339.48,
          "end": 342.9,
          "en": "I will need this to assign this input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 342.9,
          "end": 346.26,
          "en": "to one of these dynamically created controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 346.26,
          "end": 348.33,
          "en": "Because on this input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 348.33,
          "end": 352.40999999999997,
          "en": "I of course want to add the form-control CSS class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 352.40999999999997,
          "end": 354.99,
          "en": "But besides this, very important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 354.99,
          "end": 357.18,
          "en": "I need to add formControlName,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 357.18,
          "end": 360.24,
          "en": "'cause we still need to synchronize this input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 360.24,
          "end": 363.3,
          "en": "with the dynamically created input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 363.3,
          "end": 365.91,
          "en": "Now, this dynamically created input will not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 365.91,
          "end": 369.75,
          "en": "have a name chosen by us, but it isn't an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 369.75,
          "end": 372.75,
          "en": "So the name will simply be the index in this array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 372.75,
          "end": 375.03,
          "en": "which is why I'm retrieving it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 375.03,
          "end": 377.37,
          "en": "So I can simply bind form ControlName",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 377.37,
          "end": 379.59,
          "en": "and now I will need property binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 379.59,
          "end": 381.758,
          "en": "because I'm now not passing a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 381.758,
          "end": 384.78,
          "en": "I'm instead passing this local variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 384.78,
          "end": 389.34,
          "en": "I'm creating here, i, to pass this index.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 389.34,
          "end": 393.903,
          "en": "Let's save this and see if this works as expected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 394.89,
          "end": 397.83,
          "en": "If we have a look at our console, no errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 397.83,
          "end": 402.21,
          "en": "Let's click add hobby, and we indeed see a new input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 402.21,
          "end": 404.31,
          "en": "No errors still.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 404.31,
          "end": 405.69,
          "en": "Let's check it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 405.69,
          "end": 407.67,
          "en": "It's invalid, this looks good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 407.67,
          "end": 412.29,
          "en": "So if I enter a hobby here, now it becomes valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 412.29,
          "end": 415.5,
